r kanji or you may find  that it's enough just to encounter these  as you encounter them each time you  encounter them you look them up in the  gishwh kanji which is a a wonderful  dictionary and gradually just rely on  the fact that your brain will start to  get used to them so i hope that was  helpful bye for now  [Music]  you

